  "name": "Linux Server Security & Web Logs",
  "summary": "Graylog dashboard for Linux server security and web log monitoring.",
  "description": "# Linux Server Security & Web Logs\n\nA lightweight Graylog dashboard for monitoring common Linux server security and web log events.\n\n## Features\n\n- SSH failed login monitoring\n- Sudo activity monitoring\n- HTTP 404 error monitoring\n- Simple message-count visualizations\n- Designed for Linux server administrators and security monitoring\n\n## Dashboard\n\nThe dashboard includes:\n\n- SSH Failed Login Attempts\n- Sudo Activity\n- Web 404 Errors\n\nThis content pack provides a simple starting point for Linux server log monitoring and can be customized for individual environments.\n\n## Linux Server Management\n\nFor Linux server administration, monitoring, security, troubleshooting, and performance management, see [iServerSupport Linux Server Management](https://iserversupport.com/linux-server-management/).",
  "vendor": "Linux Server Management Community",
